<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="Nhận tư vấn và dự toán thiết kế, thi công nội thất từ Shome Luxury." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=6.5.34" />
  <style>
    .quote-page .quote-video-card-link { display: block; cursor: pointer; }
    .quote-page .quote-video-card-link:hover { box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(91, 57, 22, .12); transform: translateY(-2px); transition: box-shadow .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed { padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) 0; background: #fffdf9; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-heading { margin: 0 auto clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); text-align: center; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-heading p { margin: 0 0 .15rem; color: #b86a14; font-family: var(--font-script); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: .85; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-heading h2 { margin: 0; color: #1d1a19; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.5vw, 3.6rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: 1.1; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-heading h2 em { color: #ca9548; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-style: normal; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-heading > span { display: block; margin-top: .42rem; color: #7a7067; font-size: clamp(.76rem, 1.4vw, 1rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-videos { display: grid; width: min(900px, 100%); margin: auto; gap: clamp(.8rem, 1.7vw, 1.35rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-video { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 2.05 / 1; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #eadfce; border-radius: 18px; background: #2a1c12; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(76, 48, 20, .06); }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-video img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-video-shade { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(26, 17, 10, .63), rgba(26, 17, 10, .06) 68%), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(20, 13, 8, .25), transparent 55%); }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-play { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; display: grid; width: clamp(48px, 7vw, 70px); height: clamp(48px, 7vw, 70px); place-items: center; border: 3px solid #fff; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(101, 61, 22, .42); color: #fff; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.45rem); line-height: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); cursor: pointer; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-caption { position: absolute; bottom: clamp(.75rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem); left: clamp(.8rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem); color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-caption small, .quote-page .quote-completed-caption h3, .quote-page .quote-completed-caption p { color: #fff !important; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-caption small { font-size: clamp(.55rem, 1vw, .68rem); font-weight: 600; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-caption h3 { margin: .2rem 0 .28rem; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.55rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.05; }
    .quote-page .quote-completed-caption p { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(.55rem, .9vw, .68rem); }
    @media (max-width: 559px) { .quote-page .quote-completed { padding: 2.5rem 0; }.quote-page .quote-completed-videos { width: calc(100% - 24px); gap: .8rem; }.quote-page .quote-completed-video { aspect-ratio: 1.55 / 1; border-radius: 14px; }.quote-page .quote-completed-caption h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; }.quote-page .quote-completed-play { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-width: 2px; } }
    .quote-page .quote-capability { padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) 0; background: #fffdf9; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop { width: min(930px, 100%); }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-heading { margin: 0 auto 1rem; text-align: center; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-heading h2 { margin: 0; color: #191715; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.045em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-heading h2 em { display: block; margin: .3em 0 .38em; color: #bd7218; font-family: var(--font-script); font-size: 1.35em; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: .9; text-transform: none; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-heading p { margin: .15rem 0 0; color: #716961; font-size: clamp(.7rem, 1.4vw, .92rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-main { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 2.12 / 1; overflow: hidden; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #e8ddcf; border-radius: 12px; background: #382b21; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-main img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-main-shade { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(19, 13, 9, .66), transparent 38%); }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-play { position: absolute; bottom: .75rem; left: .75rem; display: grid; width: 34px; height: 34px; place-items: center; border: 2px solid #fff; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .28); color: #fff; font-size: .8rem; cursor: pointer; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-main > span { position: absolute; bottom: 1.25rem; left: 3.35rem; color: #fff; font-size: clamp(.62rem, 1vw, .75rem); font-weight: 600; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin: .65rem 0 1.2rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-stats div { display: grid; gap: .12rem; place-items: center; padding: 0 .7rem; text-align: center; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-stats div + div { border-left: 1px solid #c9c2ba; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-stats b { color: #191715; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.6vw, 1.85rem); line-height: 1; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-stats span { color: #6c645d; font-size: clamp(.58rem, 1vw, .75rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-gallery figure { margin: 0; text-align: center; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-gallery img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1.65 / 1; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: cover; }
    .quote-page .quote-workshop-gallery figcaption { margin-top: .35rem; color: #302c28; font-size: clamp(.64rem, 1.1vw, .8rem); }
    @media (max-width: 559px) { .quote-page .quote-workshop { width: calc(100% - 24px); }.quote-page .quote-workshop-main { aspect-ratio: 1.5 / 1; }.quote-page .quote-workshop-gallery { gap: .7rem; }.quote-page .quote-workshop-stats { margin-bottom: .9rem; }.quote-page .quote-workshop-stats div { padding: 0 .3rem; }.quote-page .quote-workshop-stats span { font-size: .6rem; }.quote-page .quote-workshop-main > span { bottom: 1.15rem; } }
    /* Tighter vertical rhythm across the quotation page. */
    .quote-page .quote-section { padding-top: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); padding-bottom: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-benefits { padding-top: clamp(1rem, 1.75vw, 1.5rem); padding-bottom: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-pricing { padding-top: clamp(1rem, 1.75vw, 1.5rem); padding-bottom: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-construction-cta, .quote-page .quote-brand-video, .quote-page .quote-completed, .quote-page .quote-capability { padding-top: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); padding-bottom: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-heading { margin-bottom: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-heading h2 em, .quote-page .quote-category-featured-heading h2 em { display: block; margin: .28em 0 .4em; line-height: 1; }
    @media (max-width: 767px) { .quote-page .quote-pricing { padding-bottom: .75rem; }.quote-page .quote-construction-cta { padding-top: .75rem; padding-bottom: .75rem; }.quote-page .quote-construction-card { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(0, .92fr) !important; column-gap: .6rem; min-height: 205px !important; }.quote-page .quote-construction-card > img { order: initial !important; min-height: 0 !important; max-height: none !important; height: 100% !important; border-radius: 0 13px 13px 0 !important; }.quote-page .quote-construction-copy { min-width: 0; padding: .9rem .65rem .9rem .85rem !important; }.quote-page .quote-construction-copy .quote-kicker { margin-bottom: .15rem; font-size: clamp(.88rem, 3.5vw, 1.25rem) !important; line-height: 1; }.quote-page .quote-construction-copy h2 { max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: .45rem; font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 5.2vw, 2.25rem) !important; line-height: .92; overflow-wrap: break-word; }.quote-page .quote-construction-copy > p { margin-bottom: .45rem; font-size: clamp(.64rem, 2.45vw, .86rem) !important; line-height: 1.25; }.quote-page .quote-construction-points { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: .35rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; font-size: clamp(.55rem, 2.15vw, .72rem) !important; }.quote-page .quote-construction-points span:last-child { grid-column: auto; }.quote-page .quote-construction-points span { gap: .3rem; }.quote-page .quote-construction-points i { font-size: 1.15em; }.quote-page .quote-construction-copy .quote-button { min-height: 29px; padding: .42rem .65rem; font-size: clamp(.48rem, 1.8vw, .63rem); }.quote-page .quote-construction-copy .quote-button span { margin-left: .45rem; } }
    .quote-page .quote-pricing { padding-bottom: .25rem !important; }
    .quote-page .quote-pricing + .quote-construction-cta { padding-top: .25rem !important; }
    @media (max-width: 559px) { .quote-page .quote-section, .quote-page .quote-brand-video, .quote-page .quote-completed, .quote-page .quote-capability { padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; } }
    .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship { padding: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem) 0; background: #fff; }
    .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship-inner { width: min(820px, 100%); }
    .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship-heading { margin: 0 auto 1.7rem; text-align: center; }
    .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship-heading h2 { margin: 0; padding-bottom: .8rem; color: #1d1a18; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship-heading h2 em { display: block; margin: .3em 0 .38em; color: #bd7218; font-family: var(--font-script); font-size: 1.45em; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: .9; text-transform: none; }
    .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship-heading p { max-width: 620px; margin: .35rem auto 0; color: #726a64; font-size: clamp(.72rem, 1.35vw, .9rem); line-height: 1.5; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-group + .quote-craft-group { margin-top: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.25rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-group-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-group-heading b { color: #c27a1b; font-family: var(--font-script); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-group-heading h3 { margin: 0; color: #231f1c; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem); font-weight: 700; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-group-heading::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: #ddd7d0; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-card { min-width: 0; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-photo { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1.52 / 1; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 8px; background: #e6ddd2; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-photo img { position: absolute; width: 200%; height: 200%; max-width: none; object-fit: fill; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-card:nth-child(2) .quote-craft-photo img { left: -100%; }.quote-page .quote-craft-card:nth-child(3) .quote-craft-photo img { top: -100%; }.quote-page .quote-craft-card:nth-child(4) .quote-craft-photo img { top: -100%; left: -100%; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-card h4 { margin: .42rem 0 .08rem; color: #292420; font-size: clamp(.72rem, 1.25vw, .9rem); font-weight: 700; }
    .quote-page .quote-craft-card p { margin: 0; color: #777069; font-size: clamp(.63rem, 1.05vw, .76rem); line-height: 1.35; }
    @media (max-width: 559px) { .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship { padding: .75rem 0; }.quote-page .quote-craftsmanship-inner { width: calc(100% - 24px); }.quote-page .quote-craftsmanship-heading { margin-bottom: 1.3rem; }.quote-page .quote-craft-grid { gap: .75rem .65rem; }.quote-page .quote-craft-group + .quote-craft-group { margin-top: 1.7rem; }.quote-page .quote-craft-group-heading { gap: .55rem; margin-bottom: .55rem; }.quote-page .quote-craft-card h4 { margin-top: .3rem; } }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-check { padding: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 4rem) 0; background: #fffdf9; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-inner { width: min(720px, 100%); }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-lead { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #756d66; font-size: clamp(.7rem, 1.25vw, .85rem); line-height: 1.45; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-heading { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-heading p { margin: 0 0 .35rem; color: #be7417; font-family: var(--font-script); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.1vw, 2.35rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: .9; white-space: nowrap; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-heading h2 { margin: 0; color: #1e1a18; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.08; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-heading h2 em { color: #cf9138; font-style: normal; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-list { position: relative; display: grid; gap: .75rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-list::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 1.2rem; bottom: 1.2rem; left: 1.2rem; width: 1px; background: #eadfce; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-item { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.45rem 1fr; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-item b { z-index: 1; display: grid; width: 2.45rem; height: 2.45rem; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff2db; color: #c47a1c; font-size: clamp(.78rem, 1.5vw, .95rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-item h3 { margin: 0 0 .08rem; color: #211d1a; font-size: clamp(.78rem, 1.5vw, 1rem); font-weight: 700; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-item p { margin: 0; color: #756d66; font-size: clamp(.65rem, 1.15vw, .78rem); line-height: 1.35; }
    @media (max-width: 559px) { .quote-page .quote-handover-check { padding: 1.8rem 0; }.quote-page .quote-handover-inner { width: calc(100% - 24px); }.quote-page .quote-handover-lead { margin-bottom: .75rem; }.quote-page .quote-handover-heading { margin-bottom: .85rem; }.quote-page .quote-handover-heading p { white-space: normal; }.quote-page .quote-handover-list { gap: .55rem; } }
    .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship + .quote-handover-check { padding-top: 2rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-check + .quote-section { padding-top: 2rem; }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-check { padding: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem) 0; }
    .quote-page .quote-craftsmanship + .quote-handover-check { padding-top: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); }
    .quote-page .quote-handover-check + .quote-section { padding-top: clamp(.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); }
    .quote-page, .quote-page > section:not(.quote-hero) { background: #fff !important; }
    /* Keep the assurance and pricing sections visually connected. */
    .quote-page .quote-benefits { padding-bottom: 10px !important; }
    .quote-page .quote-pricing { padding-top: 10px !important; }
    .quote-page .quote-pricing .quote-heading { margin-bottom: .9rem !important; }
    .quote-page .quote-pricing .quote-heading h2 { margin-bottom: 0 !important; }
    .quote-page .quote-pricing .quote-heading h2 em { margin: .28em 0 .4em !important; padding-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.05; }
  </style>
  <script src="/js/main.js?v=1.9.0" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/quote-page.js?v=1.0.0" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  <%- include('partials/mobile-drawer') %>
  <main id="main-content" class="quote-page">
    <% if (sections.hero?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <section class="quote-hero" style="--quote-hero-image: url('<%= sections.hero.image %>')">
        <div class="container quote-hero-inner">
          <div class="quote-hero-copy quote-brochure-copy">
            <p class="quote-kicker"><%= sections.hero.eyebrow %></p>
            <h1><em><%= quoteScript %></em><span><%= quoteTitle %></span></h1>
            <p class="quote-lead"><%= sections.hero.description %></p>
          </div>
          <div class="quote-hero-traits"><% (sections.hero.traits || []).forEach((trait, index) => { %><span><%= trait %></span><% if (index < sections.hero.traits.length - 1) { %><i aria-hidden="true"></i><% } %><% }) %></div>
          <div class="quote-hero-corner-script"><%= sections.hero.cornerScript || '' %></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    <% } %>

    <% if (sections.benefits?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <section class="quote-section quote-benefits">
        <div class="container">
          <header class="quote-heading quote-heading-center quote-benefits-heading"><p class="quote-kicker"><%= sections.benefits.title %></p><h2><%= sections.benefits.script %></h2><p><%= sections.benefits.description %></p></header>
          <div class="quote-benefit-grid">
            <% sections.benefits.items.filter(item => item.isVisible !== false).forEach((item, index) => { %>
              <% const benefitIcons = ['/images/icon-1-baogia.png', '/images/icon-2-bg.png', '/images/ic3-bg.png']; %>
              <article class="quote-benefit-card"><span class="quote-number">0<%= index + 1 %></span><div class="quote-benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="<%= benefitIcons[index] %>" alt="" /></div><div class="quote-benefit-copy"><h3><%= item.title %></h3><p><%= item.description %></p></div></article>
            <% }) %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    <% } %>

    <% if (sections.pricing?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <section class="quote-section quote-pricing" id="bao-gia-tham-khao"><div class="container"><header class="quote-heading quote-heading-center"><p class="quote-kicker"><%= sections.pricing.eyebrow %></p><h2><%= sections.pricing.title %> <em><%= sections.pricing.script %></em></h2><p><%= sections.pricing.description %></p></header><div class="quote-pricing-list"><% sections.pricing.items.filter(item => item.isVisible !== false).sort((a,b) => (a.order||0)-(b.order||0)).forEach((item, index) => { %><article class="quote-price-card"><div class="quote-price-image" role="img" aria-label="<%= item.title %>" style="--pricing-image-position: <%= index === 0 ? 'left' : index === 1 ? 'center' : 'right' %>"></div><div class="quote-price-copy"><span class="quote-price-title"><%= item.title %></span><h3><%= item.price || '' %></h3><p><%= item.description %></p><span class="quote-price-area"><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b><%= item.area || '' %></span><a class="quote-text-link" href="<%= item.ctaHref %>"><%= item.ctaLabel %> <span>→</span></a></div></article><% }) %></div></div></section>
    <% } %>

    <% if (sections.constructionCta?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <section class="quote-construction-cta"><div class="container"><div class="quote-construction-card"><div class="quote-construction-copy"><p class="quote-kicker"><%= sections.constructionCta.eyebrow %></p><h2><%= sections.constructionCta.title %></h2><p><%= sections.constructionCta.description %></p><div class="quote-construction-points"><span><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i>Tối ưu chi phí</span><span><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i>Đồng bộ thẩm mỹ</span><span><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i>Trọn gói cho căn hộ, nhà phố, văn phòng</span></div><a class="quote-button" href="<%= sections.constructionCta.ctaHref %>"><%= sections.constructionCta.ctaLabel %></a></div><img src="<%= sections.constructionCta.image %>" alt="Thi công nội thất Shome Luxury" loading="lazy" /></div></div></section>
    <% } %>

    <% if (sections.categories?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <section class="quote-section quote-category-section" id="cong-trinh-thiet-ke">
        <div class="container">
          <header class="quote-heading"><p class="quote-kicker"><%= sections.categories.eyebrow %></p><h2><%= sections.categories.title %> <em><%= sections.categories.script %></em></h2><p><%= sections.categories.description %></p></header>
          <% if (highlightProjects.length) { %><div class="quote-project-grid"><% highlightProjects.forEach(project => { %><a href="/cong-trinh/<%= project.slug %>" class="quote-project-card"><img src="<%= project.thumbnail || project.gallery?.[0] || '/images/project_apartment.jpg' %>" alt="<%= project.title %>" loading="lazy" /><span><b><%= project.title %></b><small><%= project.location || 'Shome Luxury' %></small></span></a><% }) %></div><% } else { %><p class="quote-empty-state">Các công trình nổi bật sẽ được cập nhật tại đây.</p><% } %>
        </div>
      </section>
    <% } %>

    <% if (sections.brandVideo?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <% const brandVideoUrl = sections.brandVideo.videoUrl || sections.brandVideo.ctaHref || 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcW0-8y0EMYZ381uBjcccjA'; %>
      <section class="quote-brand-video"><div class="container"><header class="quote-video-heading"><p><%= sections.brandVideo.eyebrow %></p><h2><%= sections.brandVideo.title %></h2><strong><%= sections.brandVideo.description %></strong></header><a class="quote-video-card quote-video-card-link" href="<%= brandVideoUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="<%= sections.brandVideo.ctaLabel || 'Xem trên YouTube' %>"><img src="/images/quote-brand-video-shome-luxury.png" alt="Video giới thiệu SHome Luxury" loading="lazy" /><div class="quote-video-logo"><b>SHOME <em>LUXURY</em></b><span>KIẾN TẠO KHÔNG GIAN<br />SỐNG THƯỢNG LƯU</span></div><div class="quote-video-scrim"></div><span class="quote-video-play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span><div class="quote-video-copy"><span>SHOME LUXURY</span><h3>Đơn vị thiết kế</h3><p>Thi công nội thất<br /><b>hàng đầu Việt Nam</b></p><div class="quote-video-points"><i>✦<small>Thẩm mỹ<br />tinh tế</small></i><i>◌<small>Chuyên nghiệp<br />tận tâm</small></i><i>⌂<small>Chất lượng<br />bền vững</small></i></div></div><div class="quote-video-footer"><div><b><%= sections.brandVideo.caption %></b><span><%= sections.brandVideo.description %></span></div><time><%= sections.brandVideo.duration %></time><strong><%= sections.brandVideo.ctaLabel %> <i aria-hidden="true">▶</i></strong></div></a></div></section>
    <% } %>

    <% if (sections.completed?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <section class="quote-section quote-completed"><div class="container"><header class="quote-completed-heading"><p><%= sections.completed.eyebrow %></p><h2><%= sections.completed.title %> <em><%= sections.completed.script %></em></h2><span><%= sections.completed.description %></span></header><div class="quote-completed-videos"><% sections.completed.gallery.filter(item => item.isVisible !== false).sort((a,b) => (a.order||0)-(b.order||0)).forEach((item, index) => { %><article class="quote-completed-video"><img src="<%= item.image %>" alt="<%= item.alt %>" loading="lazy" /><div class="quote-completed-video-shade"></div><button type="button" class="quote-completed-play" aria-label="Xem video <%= item.title || item.alt %>">▶</button><div class="quote-completed-caption"><small>Căn hộ <%= index + 1 %> phòng ngủ</small><h3><%= item.title || item.alt %></h3><p>● <%= item.location || 'Hà Nội' %></p></div></article><% }) %></div></div></section>
    <% } %>

    <% if (sections.capability?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <section class="quote-capability"><div class="container quote-workshop"><header class="quote-workshop-heading"><h2><%= sections.capability.eyebrow %> <em><%= sections.capability.title %></em></h2><p><%= sections.capability.description %></p></header><article class="quote-workshop-main"><img src="<%= sections.capability.image %>" alt="Xưởng sản xuất Shome Luxury" loading="lazy" /><div class="quote-workshop-main-shade"></div><button type="button" class="quote-workshop-play" aria-label="Xem video tại xưởng">▶</button><span>Xem video tại xưởng</span></article><div class="quote-workshop-stats"><% sections.capability.stats.forEach(stat => { %><div><b><%= stat.value %></b><span><%= stat.label %></span></div><% }) %></div><div class="quote-workshop-gallery"><% (sections.capability.gallery || []).forEach(item => { %><figure><img src="<%= item.image %>" alt="<%= item.alt %>" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><%= item.title %></figcaption></figure><% }) %></div></div></section>
    <% } %>

    <% const craftsmanshipGroups = [
      { number: '01', title: 'Bề mặt & góc cạnh', image: '/images/craftsmanship-surface-details-grid.png', items: [['Dán cạnh gọn đẹp', 'Mép dán sạch, liền mạch.'], ['Góc nối khít', 'Chăm chút từng điểm tiếp giáp.'], ['Bo cạnh mềm mại', 'Mượt tay ở những điểm chạm.'], ['Bề mặt chỉn chu', 'Rà soát vân gỗ và lớp hoàn thiện.']] },
      { number: '02', title: 'Phụ kiện & chuyển động', image: '/images/craftsmanship-hardware-details-grid.png', items: [['Căn chỉnh bản lề', 'Cánh cân, đóng mở nhẹ nhàng.'], ['Ray trượt êm thuận', 'Kéo mở mượt, vận hành ổn định.'], ['Khe cánh đều đẹp', 'Đồng nhất tại mọi điểm.'], ['Tay nắm ngay ngắn', 'Đúng độ cao và vị trí lắp đặt.']] },
      { number: '03', title: 'Lắp đặt & hoàn thiện', image: '/images/craftsmanship-finishing-details-grid.png', items: [['Căn chỉnh thẳng bằng', 'Kiểm tra độ phẳng và chắc chắn.'], ['Tiếp giáp gọn gàng', 'Chỉnh chu nơi tủ gặp tường.'], ['Đi dây ngăn nắp', 'Gọn đường dây, thuận tiện sử dụng.'], ['Vệ sinh hoàn thiện', 'Sạch từng góc trước bàn giao.']] }
    ]; %>
    <section class="quote-craftsmanship"><div class="container quote-craftsmanship-inner"><header class="quote-craftsmanship-heading"><h2>Tinh tế <em>Từng góc nhỏ</em></h2><p>Từ bề mặt, góc cạnh đến phụ kiện và lắp đặt.<br />Mỗi chi tiết đều được chăm chút để tổng thể đẹp và dùng bền lâu.</p></header><% craftsmanshipGroups.forEach(group => { %><section class="quote-craft-group"><header class="quote-craft-group-heading"><b><%= group.number %></b><h3><%= group.title %></h3></header><div class="quote-craft-grid"><% group.items.forEach((item, index) => { %><article class="quote-craft-card"><div class="quote-craft-photo"><img src="<%= group.image %>" alt="<%= item[0] %>" loading="lazy" /></div><h4><%= item[0] %></h4><p><%= item[1] %></p></article><% }) %></div></section><% }) %></div></section>

      <section class="quote-handover-check"><div class="container quote-handover-inner"><header class="quote-handover-heading"><p>Kiểm tra trước khi bàn giao</p><h2>Từng bước đều được <em>chăm chút</em></h2></header><div class="quote-handover-list"><article class="quote-handover-item"><b>01</b><div><h3>Đo kiểm kích thước</h3><p>Đối chiếu chỉ số với bản vẽ.</p></div></article><article class="quote-handover-item"><b>02</b><div><h3>Lắp thử &amp; căn chỉnh</h3><p>Kiểm tra liên kết, bản lề và ray trượt.</p></div></article><article class="quote-handover-item"><b>03</b><div><h3>Rà soát &amp; đóng gói</h3><p>Vệ sinh bề mặt, bảo vệ góc cạnh khi vận chuyển.</p></div></article></div></div></section>

    <% if (sections.estimate?.isVisible !== false) { %>
      <section class="quote-free-estimate" id="nhan-du-toan"><div class="container"><div class="quote-free-estimate-card"><img class="quote-free-estimate-image" src="/images/quote-free-estimate-interior.png" alt="Nhận dự toán miễn phí từ SHome Luxury" loading="lazy" /><div class="quote-free-estimate-copy"><h2>Nhận dự toán <em>miễn phí</em></h2><p>Để lại thông tin, chuyên gia <strong>SHome Luxury</strong> sẽ liên hệ tư vấn trong 24h.</p><ul><li><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i><span>Tư vấn nhanh<br />trong 24h</span></li><li><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i><span>Báo giá chi tiết,<br />minh bạch</span></li><li><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i><span>Không cam kết,<br />không ràng buộc</span></li></ul><a class="quote-free-estimate-button" href="/lien-he">LIÊN HỆ ĐỂ NHẬN BÁO GIÁ</a></div></div></div></section>
    <% } %>

    <section class="quote-final-faq" aria-labelledby="quote-final-faq-title"><div class="container quote-final-faq-inner"><h2 id="quote-final-faq-title">Câu hỏi thường gặp</h2><div class="quote-final-faq-list"><details open><summary><b>01</b><span>Thời gian thiết kế và thi công mất bao lâu?</span><i class="quote-final-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 10" focusable="false"><path d="m1 1 7 7 7-7" /></svg></i></summary><p>Tiến độ được xây dựng theo quy mô và hiện trạng công trình. SHome Luxury sẽ gửi lộ trình chi tiết sau khi khảo sát và chốt phương án.</p></details><details><summary><b>02</b><span>Báo giá có phát sinh thêm chi phí không?</span><i class="quote-final-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 10" focusable="false"><path d="m1 1 7 7 7-7" /></svg></i></summary><p>Báo giá được lập rõ theo hạng mục, vật liệu và khối lượng. Mọi thay đổi phát sinh chỉ được thực hiện khi có xác nhận từ bạn.</p></details><details><summary><b>03</b><span>SHome Luxury có chính sách bảo hành không?</span><i class="quote-final-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 10" focusable="false"><path d="m1 1 7 7 7-7" /></svg></i></summary><p>Chúng tôi bảo hành theo từng hạng mục thi công và đồng hành hỗ trợ sau bàn giao để công trình luôn vận hành ổn định.</p></details><details><summary><b>04</b><span>Tôi có thể điều chỉnh thiết kế trước khi thi công không?</span><i class="quote-final-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 10" focusable="false"><path d="m1 1 7 7 7-7" /></svg></i></summary><p>Có. Đội ngũ sẽ tiếp nhận góp ý, điều chỉnh phương án và chỉ triển khai khi bạn đã thống nhất về thiết kế, vật liệu và chi phí.</p></details></div></div></section>

  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
